Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：星光他还活着。如此相信着的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘上了时空移动装置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算出发前往星光世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那时 巴利安又一次出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装置的能源还没有填充完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了送我出发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安和快斗Ｖ的决斗开始了＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的 No.卡明明确实被召唤出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Ｖ)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔 确实在哦我的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔——咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭你们那对窟窿眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是看不见我的怪兽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗：怎么回事 刚才那阵眩晕？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Ｖ)怎么了 快斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《咔咔咔……差不多该来了吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.35,0:00:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～那家伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.21,0:01:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽应该就在某处才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在某处……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看见了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.65,0:01:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看见了！那个那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.51,0:01:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，就在那家伙左肩附近。你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)啊，有了！那就是 No.怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好小！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于明白了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是 No.怪兽2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.19,0:01:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊学忍者 影蚊帐是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《攻击力为零的 No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕隐藏着某种强力的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 不管是怎样的钟首先 不试着敲一敲的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不会知道它的音色的》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 大音·球体
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对暗影·蚊帐发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了 那家伙受到了大伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔！ 太天真 太天真了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动了暗影·蚊帐的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影·蚊帐是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超载单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗中产生的伤害归零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让怪兽的破坏无效化的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是 暗影·蚊帐的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正可怕之处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还远远 在后面…》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《将战斗中的伤害归零的效果吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 应该不止如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 到底在想什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 装置的能源填充率怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 呃… 现在72%。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔！ 要送你的朋友上路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来还得花不少时间啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《差不多 我注入的毒也该见效了吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔… 暗影摩斯基特是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗伤害归零的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此…》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久没狩猎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对暗影摩斯基特发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和进行战斗的对手怪兽一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从场上除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的怪兽会回到场上，但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.47,0:05:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果对手是怪兽EXCEEDS的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元全部被送入墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？为什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果没有发动！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！银河眼早就
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被下毒了啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一种叫幻觉计数物的猛毒。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻觉计数物？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在V的回合 暗影·摩斯基特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量单元的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不仅将战斗伤害和怪兽的破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还能给场上的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放置幻觉计数物。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 暗影·摩斯基特会通过幻觉计数物的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与带有幻觉指示物的怪兽战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:06:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被破坏将发生的伤害无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并把相同的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗是骑乘决斗规则。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.37,0:06:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，要让哪一边吃下伤害呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼与暗影鼹鼠的战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生的伤害是3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去，其中一方就要……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戴森球那种蠢货，我可是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超级不爽的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以该吃伤害的是你，V！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 微缩力场发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上表侧表示怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Ｖ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧。唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克莉丝，你没事……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么回事，到底……》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来，给海马本人下的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毒也真正开始见效了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了海马，振作点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗可不是普通的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事，我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，该打倒谁你也明白吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我一定要打倒你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈，要打倒我么。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底你在说什么啊，海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有本事的话就来试试看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我正有此意。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这狂妄的家伙，连同你的那帮废物手下一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统统打进地狱去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马……。海马那家伙 到底……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然突然打倒了V怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《咔叽咔叽注入海马体内的毒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有让人产生幻觉的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 军队·摩斯基特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}血之指挥官！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有暗影·摩斯基特的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把血之指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地，给对手1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放置一个幻觉指示物 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以放置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，大宇宙球！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你的怪兽也都得听我摆布了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，从手牌发动魔法卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，每有1只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放置了幻觉指示物的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就造成600点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将伤害给予那只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制者。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……。发动陷阱卡，弹性空间！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在效果伤害发生的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个伤害无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将发生的伤害给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃下这1200点伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克莉丝……。发动陷阱卡，交换能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将我方场上1只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减少与发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害相同的数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个伤害无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼～ 好险啊。谢了啊，海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然不惜降低银河眼的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也要去帮敌人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:10:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马那家伙 绝对有问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错那家伙 已经不正常了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了我 事先
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}注入的毒呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你不可能有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给海马注入毒的闲暇。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们 来到这里的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经动过手脚了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就扎了那么一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 那个时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发现得太晚了。太迟钝可是会被女孩子讨厌的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔… 这场决斗要想获胜{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼应该就是关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但快斗被毒侵蚀陷入了幻觉之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须将他从幻觉中解放出来…》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((哈… 哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]克里斯 住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一周你们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不眠不休地在决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！ 陷阱发动！ 残骸爆破！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 咕！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了!? 说了让你站起来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.94,0:11:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]克里斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是为了把决斗者的生存本能{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升到极限的实验再继续下去也不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.05,0:11:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并非不可能！只要生命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还剩1点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪怕心脏停止跳动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仍继续决斗的才是真正的决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 再这样下去真的海马会有生命危险啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无所谓！ 如果在这里倒下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那海马终究 也不过是这种程度的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 当他跨越这一切重新站起来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一个个细胞中被深深烙印的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的强烈意志
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会让海马成为真正的决斗者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要让海马恢复理智…》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用戴森球{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对银河眼光子龙\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎!? 为什么V要攻击快斗啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的生命值只有2000！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击要是打中了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗可就完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔咔 怎么了V。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没招了急昏头了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 这就结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《V：觉醒吧 快斗！》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为决斗者的本能！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((呜哦～!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 快斗 就这样))
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被我拿下了吗！ 咔～咔咔咔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？ 为什么生命值还剩着！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为我发动了陷阱卡「预防·重生」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才做到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是，自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只攻击表示怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让战斗伤害下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马，你终于醒过来了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…你从幻觉中清醒过来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为决斗者的我的生存本能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激活了免疫系统{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炽热燃烧的抗体将血液中的毒素烧尽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.46,0:14:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事怎么可能!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢用这种无聊的小把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚弄我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份罪过，我要让你用几万倍来偿还！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「预防·重生」的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将战斗中破坏的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 根据预防复活的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能复活的只有怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.96,0:14:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幻觉指示物还在墓地里！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你设下的陷阱就全部埋葬了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咔咔…。成功了！ 开始反击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是他就那样没醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:14:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还以为会怎么样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)那是不可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马是我培养出的真正的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一击不可能不让他醒来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这些家伙… 多么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多么 厉害的家伙们啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直难以置信被如此强烈的羁绊连接着。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我也一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着不输给任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强烈羁绊相连的家伙在…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶… 阿斯特拉尔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将两张卡盖伏 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击暗影·摩斯基特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼在战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对方一只怪兽一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从场上除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 你怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 暗影·摩斯基特的超量素材!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 因这个效果被除外的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗结束时 返回场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到场上的银河眼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每将一张超量素材送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗影蚊子什么的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就像被拔了翅膀的蚊子一样！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！ 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊学忍法…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡以没有超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽为对象发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}军蚊怪兽全部除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只 攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}军蚊怪兽 总共有4只。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此合计提升4000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 还藏着杀手锏吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！那么巨大的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不是不讨厌的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 讨厌啊。最讨厌了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 要把你们两个人一起拖下水吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊取闪光的更进一步效果 发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果对象中的怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予你们与其攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合结束之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你们的末日吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别动 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 不是你该动的时候。可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们之所以在这里战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了把这家伙送去星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那无法实现的话什么样的胜利都毫无意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在胡扯些什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蚊香闪光已经发动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的决斗也已经结束了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就等着被无情地轰飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算九十九游马去了星光世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也会把那装置砸个稀巴烂让他再也回不到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界来你是这个意思吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你是看到了自己获胜的幻觉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我就来让你清醒清醒，做好觉悟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法 永恒魔法。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果与对方墓地中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一张永续魔法相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择克里斯墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择全息投影！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全息投影是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择场上1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其视为与那只怪兽相同的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼变成2只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底不过是全息投影
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}制造出来的冒牌货。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能自己主动攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.25,0:19:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦成为攻击或效果的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会立刻被破坏，是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 首先让我用这张！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱 发动！ 力量分析。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让己方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机械族怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合内 变成与对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的攻击力相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将戴森球体的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和银河眼一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，陷阱卡发动！悖论·新星！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上一只超量怪兽和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方一只等级5以上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后将它们的攻击力合计加在对方一只怪兽身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将戴森球和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全息投影解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将它们合计8000点的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加在银河眼身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:20:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力一万两千！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好大～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但……但是，你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗阶段已经结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管攻击力提升多少都是白费力气～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 奇迹·银河！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有产生伤害的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择自己场上的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让它再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的忏悔什么的根本没有听的价值！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用银河眼·光子·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对暗影·摩斯基特发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在地狱的业火中燃烧吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.98,0:21:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮 海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗…… 太精彩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你 克里斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能量填充率达到100%了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.24,0:21:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}启程的时候似乎到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把星光带回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对… 绝对要回来哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说好了… 不许反悔哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我 星光。绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把你带回来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.03,0:22:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是要火力全开啊！

